  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Window to Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main message for our project is to emphasize the importance and inclusiveness in global development cooperation. As for our case it will be in Lamjung, Nepal.  Target Group: Our primary target audience is Danish youth from age of 20-29 interested in global development agenda. The target group will see content from the community in Lamjung, Nepal, where we will document activities through photos and videos for social media, particularly on Facebook and Instagram.   We will be writing stories, newsletters, and video editing, benefiting both local and national organizations (DUF, DRCY and NRCS) and enhancing our awareness-raising campaign. It will enable us to create visually appealing content and write stories/blogposts about our project.</narrative>
  </description>
